title: Start
// Corresponds to Scene 1 in the narrative script
// Jovan = char 1
// Ruzica = char 2
---
<<declare $protagName = "Marc">>
<<declare $lover1Name = "Jovan">>
<<declare $lover2Name = "Ruzica">>

<<zeroChar>>
Over the PA System: Good morning, the museum is now open. 
Over the PA System: Please feel free to stop by our brand new exhibit, the Memory Tree! 
Over the PA System: Explore the past, embrace the present. 

{$protagName}: (<i>Guess that's my cue</i>).
{$protagName}: (<i>It's only my second day, but the tree's already looking better. It's really coming together.</i>)

Unknown Voice: Hi, are you Marc?

<<twoChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 0>>
<<changeSprite 2 0>>
<<darken 1>>
<<darken 2>>
A pair of adults approaches, both wearing wedding rings.
The woman is looking directly at you with a smile.
The man is gazing intently at the <b>Memory Tree</b>.

<<lighten 1>>
The Man: The tree looks a little bare, but the rest of the exhibit looks great!
<<darken 1>>

-> {$protagName}: Yeah, it's still a work in progress.
    <<lighten 1>>
    The Man: I see, well I'm sure that the end result will look fantastic!
    <<darken 1>>
-> {$protagName}: It's going to take a while.
    <<lighten 1>>
    The Man: Well, if it looks this great now, I'm sure that it can only get better!
    <<darken 1>>
-> {$protagName}: I don't think it's going to look much better.
    <<lighten 1>>
    The Man: (Frowning) I see. Well, difference of opinion, I suppose.
    <<darken 1>>
// This line was added because otherwise Jovan's response hovered in the text box
{$protagName}: (<i>I should formally start the interview.</i>)
-> {$protagName}: I'm Marc. What are your names?
    <<lighten 2>>
    {$lover2Name}: Hello, I'm {$lover2Name}, and this is my husband, {$lover1Name}.
    <<darken 2>>
-> {$protagName}: I guess you're here for the interview?
    <<lighten 2>>
    {$lover2Name}: (Frowning) Yes, I'm {$lover2Name}, and this is my husband, {$lover1Name}.
    <<darken 2>>

{$protagName}: It's nice to meet you both. 
{$protagName}: Are you two ready to start the interview?

<<lighten 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$lover2Name} and {$lover1Name} give each other a look, and turn to Marc with small smiles on their faces.
<<darken 2>>
{$lover1Name} grabs {$lover2Name}'s hand.
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover2Name}: As ready as we'll ever be...
<<lighten 2>>
===
